{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadvale is a fantasy RPG where you have no inventory and may use only what you can carry in your two hands. You are shipwrecked off the coast of a strange, unknown land, a mysterious place that is now your prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for weapons and equipment, survive hand-to-hand combat with dangerous enemies, explore an interactive, physics-based environment, and discover powerful foes in your journey across the forsaken land in which you find yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand, reaction based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive, physics-based environment</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504850?t=1757025414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504850?t=1757025414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504850/c591c05bf460d9b29f3b0e4944280b11eef726d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757025414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504850/c591c05bf460d9b29f3b0e4944280b11eef726d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757025414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":3523790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadvale is a fantasy RPG where you have no inventory and may use only what you can carry in your two hands. You are shipwrecked off the coast of a strange, unknown land, a mysterious place that is now your prison.</p><p class=\"bb_para